<title>NAMIBIA: SOCCER-NAMIBIA BEAT ZIMBABWE 2-1 IN COSAFA CUP MATCH. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NAMIBIA BEAT ZIMBABWE 2-1 IN COSAFA CUP MATCH. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WINDHOEK 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects score from 1-0 to 2-1)</p>
<p>Namibia beat Zimbabwe 2-1</p>
<p>after extra time (halftime 0-0, 90 mins 1-1) in their</p>
<p>Conferation of Southern African Football Associations (COSAFA)</p>
<p>Cup first round match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Namibia - Johannes Hindjou 87 pen, 119 pen</p>
<p>Zimbabwe - Gilbert Mushanganashika 76 pen</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,000</p>
</text>
